+- [x] No new dependencies (`go.mod`/`go.sum` untouched)
+- [x] No `Phase N` strings, no TODO/FIXME, no skipped/weakened tests
+- [x] `acceptance/`, `harness/` (except this file), Makefile, golden files untouched
+- [x] Frozen API + constants pinned by tests (`TestThresholdsAreFrozen`)
+- [x] `make check-fast` green; `e2e-task` no-op green; committed; worktree clean of task artifacts
